    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "3. Learned counsel for the applicant would submit that there was allegation that the applicant,\nserving as a clerk in the educational institution, has not timely deposited the fees and therefore the\nallegation of misappropriation, forgery and cheating.",
